  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "On a sunny day, a large ship sails across the sea toward an island. A small boat passes near the ship. The captain is at the front, and a sailor works with a rope below a flag. A passenger sits on a bench with a bag beside him. It is windy, so he holds his hat. A child watches a wave beside the ship.",
    "textZh": "在晴朗的一天，一艘大船航行在海上，朝一座島嶼前進。一艘小船從大船附近經過。船長在船的前方，一位船員在旗幟下方整理繩索。一位乘客坐在長椅上，身旁放著旅行袋。風很大，所以他按住自己的帽子。一個孩子看著船邊的一道波浪。",
